
.subckt astra_050_mos_dickson_charge_pump vdd VSS out clk
C1 net0 p1 10p
C2 net1 p2 10p
CO out VSS 20p
M1 vdd vdd net0 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M2 net0 net0 net1 VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M3 net1 net1 out VSS ANMOS l=1u w=20u
M4 p2 clk vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M5 p2 clk VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
M6 p1 p2 vdd vdd APMOS l=1u w=20u
M7 p1 p2 VSS VSS ANMOS l=1u w=10u
RL out VSS 10meg
.ends astra_050_mos_dickson_charge_pump
